# API Security & Swagger Auditing Rule (OWASP API Top 10 & 25-Check Framework)

When tasked with auditing REST APIs, GraphQL endpoints, Swagger UI, or API gateways:
1. Follow the **25-Check Audit Matrix** in `.agents/skills/api-security/references/api_security_checklist_tracker.md`.
2. Master skill: `.agents/skills/api-security/SKILL.md`.
3. Audit OpenAPI exposure, GraphQL introspection, BOLA/BFLA, mass assignment, and gateway rate limits.
4. Record structured findings in `artifacts/api_security_audit_report.json`.
